## 8. API Specification

API menggunakan REST dengan JSON:API sebagai referensi format.

Contoh endpoint:

### Organization

GET `/api/v1/organizations`

GET `/api/v1/organizations/{id}`

POST `/api/v1/organizations`

PATCH `/api/v1/organizations/{id}`

GET `/api/v1/organizations/{id}/members`

### Membership

GET `/api/v1/users/{id}/memberships`

POST `/api/v1/users/{id}/memberships`

DELETE `/api/v1/users/{id}/memberships/{membershipId}`

### User Access

GET `/api/v1/users/{id}/accesses`

POST `/api/v1/users/{id}/accesses`

DELETE `/api/v1/users/{id}/accesses/{accessId}`

### Transactions

GET `/api/v1/donations`

POST `/api/v1/donations`

GET `/api/v1/donations/{id}`

PATCH `/api/v1/donations/{id}`

### JSON:API Response Example

```json
{
  "data": {
    "type": "donations",
    "id": "1001",
    "attributes": {
      "transaction_number": "INV-001",
      "donor_name": "Ahmad",
      "amount": "1000000.00"
    },
    "relationships": {
      "organization": {
        "data": {
          "type": "organization-units",
          "id": "4"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

